00:20:04.170 --> 00:20:05.762
House of Horror

00:22:23.309 --> 00:22:27.713
I can't lose heart, but
I'm not frantic either

00:22:27.713 --> 00:22:31.183
In this wonderful city of dreams,
Tokyo Life

00:22:31.183 --> 00:22:36.155
With extraordinary effort
and a little miracle

00:22:36.155 --> 00:22:40.592
I get the feeling that it'll
be rosy and shining soon

00:22:42.495 --> 00:22:46.999
My life in Tokyo is so smooth,
don't I look chic?

00:22:46.999 --> 00:22:50.236
I even did research on
the most trendy clothes

00:22:50.236 --> 00:22:54.874
Now clubs recognize me
and just let me in

00:22:54.874 --> 00:22:58.978
My favorites are my mini-skirts

00:22:58.978 --> 00:23:02.615
It's important to bond
with my friends

00:23:02.615 --> 00:23:06.519
So of course I have a cell phone

00:23:06.519 --> 00:23:14.160
I got it by working hard at a job
that I can't talk about

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:18.230
I can't lose heart, but
I'm not frantic either

00:23:18.230 --> 00:23:21.901
In this wonderful city of dreams,
Tokyo Life

00:23:21.901 --> 00:23:24.070
I don't know what I want to do

00:23:24.070 --> 00:23:31.442
It seems these facts of loneliness
keep pouring down

00:23:33.746 --> 00:23:37.850
I don't know why I feel so sad,
I can't even cry

00:23:37.850 --> 00:23:41.520
In this wonderful city of dreams,
Tokyo Life

00:23:41.520 --> 00:23:46.359
When I hear "How are you holding up"
in that familiar voice

00:23:46.359 --> 00:23:50.921
It feels like something's tugging
at my heartstrings

00:23:55.134 --> 00:24:20.126
Next Happy Lesson

00:24:20.126 --> 00:24:25.086
Next Happy Lesson
